---
layout: base.njk
title: Email Campaigns
description: "Admin-only, resumable member email campaigns."
noindex: true
permalink: /admin/email-campaigns/
emailCampaigns: true
---

{% from "partials/auth-login-gate.njk" import authLoginGate %}

<div class="page-header"><div class="container"><p class="page-header__eyebrow">Admin</p><h1 class="page-header__title">Email campaigns</h1></div></div>

<div class="section"><div class="container"><div data-admin-container>
  {{ authLoginGate("campaign-magic-email", "Sign in required", "Enter your admin email address and we will send a secure sign-in link.", "admin", false) }}
  <div class="auth-gate" data-admin-only-gate hidden><div class="auth-gate__icon" aria-hidden="true">⛔</div><h2 class="auth-gate__title">Access restricted</h2><p class="auth-gate__body">This campaign workspace is for group administrators only.</p></div>
  <div class="auth-content" data-admin-content hidden>
    <div class="callout callout--warning"><span class="callout__icon" aria-hidden="true">⚠️</span><div class="callout__content"><p class="callout__title">Deliberately hard to send by accident</p><p>Campaigns contact only the audience described for each tool. Preview recalculates the audience without revealing addresses. Sending requires the exact current count and proceeds in resumable batches of 10.</p></div></div>

    <section class="dashboard-panel" data-custom-email-campaign>
      <div class="dashboard-panel__header"><div><p class="dashboard-panel__eyebrow">Reusable campaigns</p><h2 class="dashboard-panel__title">Create a member email campaign</h2></div></div>
      <p>Write Markdown for verified members who have consented to contact. Preview saves a draft and renders the exact branded HTML and plain-text alternatives. A sent campaign is immutable; “Tweak and rerun” creates a new run with its own delivery ledger.</p>

      <div class="email-campaign-editor">
        <form class="stack" data-custom-campaign-form>
          <div class="form-group"><label for="custom-campaign-name">Campaign name</label><input id="custom-campaign-name" data-custom-campaign-name maxlength="100" required placeholder="August member update"></div>
          <div class="form-group"><label for="custom-campaign-subject">Email subject</label><input id="custom-campaign-subject" data-custom-campaign-subject maxlength="200" required placeholder="A quick update for I-PACE owners"></div>
          <div class="form-group">
            <label for="custom-campaign-markdown">Email content (Markdown)</label>
            <textarea id="custom-campaign-markdown" data-custom-campaign-markdown rows="18" maxlength="20000" required placeholder="Hi &#123;&#123;memberFirstName&#125;&#125;,&#10;&#10;We now have &#123;&#123;membersJoined&#125;&#125; members."></textarea>
            <p class="form-hint">Personal details are substituted separately for each email. Links must use https, http or mailto.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="form-group">
            <span class="form-label">Insert a substitution</span>
            <div class="cluster email-campaign-placeholders" data-custom-campaign-placeholders aria-label="Available substitutions">
              {% for placeholder in ["membersJoined", "membersVerified", "memberFirstName", "memberLastName", "memberTittle", "memberTitle", "memberJoined", "memberVerified", "memberVehicles", "vehiclesRegisteredCount", "vehiclesSoHReadingsCount"] %}
                <button type="button" class="email-campaign-placeholder" data-custom-placeholder="{{ placeholder }}">&#123;&#123;{{ placeholder }}&#125;&#125;</button>
              {% endfor %}
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="cluster">
            <button type="submit" class="btn btn--primary" data-custom-campaign-preview>Save draft and preview</button>
            <button type="button" class="btn btn--secondary" data-custom-campaign-new>Clear and create new</button>
          </div>
        </form>

        <section class="email-preview" data-custom-campaign-email-preview hidden aria-labelledby="custom-email-preview-title">
          <p class="dashboard-panel__eyebrow">Personalised preview</p>
          <h3 id="custom-email-preview-title">Rendered member email</h3>
          <p><strong>Subject:</strong> <span data-custom-campaign-email-subject></span></p>
          <div class="email-preview__viewport"><iframe data-custom-campaign-email-html title="Rendered HTML custom member email preview" sandbox></iframe></div>
          <details class="email-preview__plain"><summary>View plain-text alternative</summary><pre data-custom-campaign-email-text></pre></details>
        </section>
      </div>

      <div data-custom-campaign-summary class="stack" aria-live="polite"></div>
      <form data-custom-campaign-send class="stack email-campaign-step">
        <div><p class="dashboard-panel__eyebrow">Confirmed delivery</p><h3>Send this saved campaign</h3><p>Editing after preview disables delivery until the updated draft is previewed again.</p></div>
        <div class="form-group"><label for="custom-campaign-confirm">Type the exact confirmation shown below</label><input id="custom-campaign-confirm" data-custom-campaign-confirm autocomplete="off" disabled><p class="form-hint" data-custom-campaign-confirm-hint>Save and preview the campaign first.</p></div>
        <button type="submit" class="btn btn--danger" data-custom-campaign-send-button disabled>Send emails</button>
      </form>
      <p data-custom-campaign-status role="status" aria-live="polite">No email has been sent.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="dashboard-panel email-campaign-panel" data-email-campaign-history>
      <div class="dashboard-panel__header"><div><p class="dashboard-panel__eyebrow">Campaign ledger</p><h2 class="dashboard-panel__title">Previous campaigns</h2></div><button type="button" class="btn btn--secondary btn--sm" data-campaign-history-refresh>Refresh history</button></div>
      <p>Each run keeps its own draft, audience snapshot, delivery totals and timestamps. Reusing an old campaign always starts a separate run, so the original record remains auditable.</p>
      <div data-campaign-history-list class="email-campaign-history" aria-live="polite"><p>Loading campaign history…</p></div>
      <p data-campaign-history-status role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
    </section>

    <section class="dashboard-panel" data-email-campaign data-preview-endpoint="/api/admin/reengagement-preview" data-send-endpoint="/api/admin/reengagement-send">
      <div class="dashboard-panel__header"><div><p class="dashboard-panel__eyebrow">Email people who have not finished signing up</p><h2 class="dashboard-panel__title">Send registration reminder emails</h2></div></div>
      <p>Each recipient gets a fresh Firebase sign-in link and the same consent-aware message used by the operator CLI. Registered accounts are suppressed immediately before every batch.</p>

      <div class="email-campaign-step">
        <p class="dashboard-panel__eyebrow">Step 1</p>
        <h3>Check the recipients and preview the email</h3>
        <p>No email is sent during this step.</p>
        <div class="cluster"><button type="button" class="btn btn--primary" data-campaign-preview>Check recipients and load email preview</button></div>
      </div>
      <div data-campaign-summary class="stack" aria-live="polite"></div>

      <section class="email-preview" data-campaign-email-preview hidden aria-labelledby="email-preview-title">
        <p class="dashboard-panel__eyebrow">Email preview</p>
        <h3 id="email-preview-title">What each recipient will receive</h3>
        <p><strong>Subject:</strong> <span data-campaign-email-subject></span></p>
        <div class="email-preview__viewport"><iframe data-campaign-email-html title="Rendered HTML registration-reminder email preview" sandbox></iframe></div>
        <details class="email-preview__plain"><summary>View plain-text alternative</summary><pre data-campaign-email-text></pre></details>
      </section>

      <form data-campaign-send class="stack email-campaign-step">
        <div><p class="dashboard-panel__eyebrow">Step 2</p><h3>Confirm and send the emails</h3><p>The controls unlock after Step 1 confirms the current audience.</p></div>
        <div class="form-group"><label for="campaign-confirm">Type the exact confirmation shown below</label><input id="campaign-confirm" data-campaign-confirm autocomplete="off" disabled><p class="form-hint" data-campaign-confirm-hint>Check the recipients and email preview first.</p></div>
        <button type="submit" class="btn btn--danger" data-campaign-send-button disabled>Send emails</button>
      </form>
      <p data-campaign-status role="status" aria-live="polite">No email has been sent.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="dashboard-panel email-campaign-panel" data-email-campaign data-preview-endpoint="/api/admin/member-referral-preview" data-send-endpoint="/api/admin/member-referral-send">
      <div class="dashboard-panel__header"><div><p class="dashboard-panel__eyebrow">Email registered members</p><h2 class="dashboard-panel__title">Ask members to invite one more I-PACE owner</h2></div></div>
      <p>This friendly referral email goes only to registered members whose Join record includes contact consent. It explains our progress towards 1,000 members and asks each person to help one more owner find the group.</p>
      <div class="email-campaign-step">
        <p class="dashboard-panel__eyebrow">Step 1</p><h3>Check the recipients and preview the email</h3><p>No email is sent during this step.</p>
        <div class="cluster"><button type="button" class="btn btn--primary" data-campaign-preview>Check recipients and load email preview</button></div>
      </div>
      <div data-campaign-summary class="stack" aria-live="polite"></div>
      <section class="email-preview" data-campaign-email-preview hidden aria-labelledby="referral-email-preview-title">
        <p class="dashboard-panel__eyebrow">Email preview</p><h3 id="referral-email-preview-title">What each recipient will receive</h3>
        <p><strong>Subject:</strong> <span data-campaign-email-subject></span></p>
        <div class="email-preview__viewport"><iframe data-campaign-email-html title="Rendered HTML member-referral email preview" sandbox></iframe></div>
        <details class="email-preview__plain"><summary>View plain-text alternative</summary><pre data-campaign-email-text></pre></details>
      </section>
      <form data-campaign-send class="stack email-campaign-step">
        <div><p class="dashboard-panel__eyebrow">Step 2</p><h3>Confirm and send the emails</h3><p>The controls unlock after Step 1 confirms the current audience.</p></div>
        <div class="form-group"><label for="referral-campaign-confirm">Type the exact confirmation shown below</label><input id="referral-campaign-confirm" data-campaign-confirm autocomplete="off" disabled><p class="form-hint" data-campaign-confirm-hint>Check the recipients and email preview first.</p></div>
        <button type="submit" class="btn btn--danger" data-campaign-send-button disabled>Send emails</button>
      </form>
      <p data-campaign-status role="status" aria-live="polite">No email has been sent.</p>
    </section>
  </div>
</div></div></div>
